@startuml
title Figure 10. Signup, Verification, and Automatic Membership
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 65
actor User
boundary "Next.js Signup UI" as UI
control "Nginx Gateway" as GW
control "AuthController" as C
control "AuthService" as S
control "EmailService" as E
database "Prisma / PostgreSQL" as DB
User -> UI : Submit name, email, password
UI -> GW : POST /auth/signup
GW -> C : Forward request
C -> S : register(dto)
S -> DB : Find matching root domain/allowlist
S -> S : Normalize email; hash password
S -> DB : Transaction: create user, token,\nand eligible membership
S -> E : Send verification link
E --> User : Time-limited link
User -> UI : Open verification link
UI -> GW : GET /auth/verify-email?token=...
GW -> C : Forward token
C -> S : verifyEmail(token)
S -> DB : Atomically mark token used\nand user verified
S --> UI : Verification result
@enduml



